er-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 標高差により下千本・中千本・上千本・奥千本と順に咲き上がり、例年4月上旬〜中旬にかけて山全体が約3万本の山桜でピンクに染まります。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            天川村「洞川温泉（どろがわおんせん）」の街並みと縁側文化とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 大峯山への行者を迎えてきた宿場町で、木造三階建ての旅館が連なり、夕暮れには提灯が灯り縁側で涼むレトロな風景が広がります。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            洞川温泉の名水グルメ「名水とうふ」と「ごろごろ水」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 名水百選に選ばれたミネラル豊富な湧水で作る豆腐は極上の滑らかさで、湯豆腐や冷奴、鮎の塩焼きが名物です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！奈良県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 奈良県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/asuka-kashihara-oomiwa-horyuji-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】飛鳥・橿原・法隆寺おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">生駒郡斑鳩町・橿原市・桜井市・高市郡明日香村（法隆寺・橿原神宮・大和八木・大神神社・飛鳥石舞台）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/nara-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】奈良おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">奈良県全域（奈良公園ならまち若草山・吉野山千本桜洞川温泉・飛鳥橿原法隆寺・十津川温泉郷）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/nara-park-naramachi-todaiji-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】奈良公園・ならまちおすすめ高級宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">奈良市（奈良公園・東大寺・春日大社・興福寺・ならまち・若草山・近鉄奈良駅・JR奈良駅）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/totsukawa-onsen-kumano-kodo-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】十津川温泉・熊野古道おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">吉野郡十津川村・野迫川村・上北山村（十津川温泉郷・湯泉地温泉・上湯温泉・谷瀬の吊り橋・熊野古道小辺路）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/mie-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【三重県】【2026年最新】三重おすすめホテル・温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">三重県全域（伊勢神宮・二見浦・鳥羽温泉郷・志摩賢島・湯の山温泉・ナガシマ）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/kyoto-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【京都府】【2026年最新】京都おすすめホテル・高級旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">京都府全域（京都駅前・祇園東山・嵐山嵯峨野・海の京都天橋立）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/osaka-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【大阪府】【2026年最新】大阪おすすめ高級ホテル・旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">大阪府全域（梅田大阪駅中之島キタ・難波心斎橋道頓堀ミナミ・天王寺あべのハルカス新世界新大阪・USJベイエリア箕面）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/wakayama-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【和歌山県】【2026年最新】和歌山おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">和歌山県全域（南紀白浜白良浜・那智勝浦熊野古道・高野山宿坊龍神温泉・和歌山城加太）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}